# Contexts used by this repository:
#   pi-pocket (default image): context "." with -f images/Containerfile
#   pi-pocket-portal:          context "portal" with -f portal/Containerfile
# The pi-pocket Containerfile clones upstream itself, so this file mainly keeps
# local build artifacts and VCS data out of any root-context build (for example
# the Makefile, which builds from the repository root).
.git
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.cache
**/dist
**/.smoke
*.log
.DS_Store
